#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:3
#: ec27cf45101846809a125247cf0f4ce3
msgid "周期溶剂盒（Solvent Box Fill）"
msgstr "Solvent Box Fill"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:5
#: 0bf9dd61a3b94ac993ac762a6df7f7e5
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:7
#: d58996eb66024ce09a553eae958097b3
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:9
#: ace3f155680345dcae3cd657d460f5dc
msgid ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` 在已有周期性晶胞的整个 cell 中随机插入溶剂分子，适合从空"
"盒、干结构或稀疏溶剂结构生成周期溶剂候选初态。输入可以没有原子，但必须有有限"
"且非奇异的 cell，并且至少一个周期方向开启。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:11
#: dc18e84f11c0496da4f9de77385c05d5
msgid ""
"它解决的是“训练集缺少周期溶剂环境”的覆盖问题，不替代分子动力学平衡或量化优"
"化。各模式下分子位置和整体取向都采用随机采样；`water`、`loose`、`dense` 主要"
"改变默认碰撞半径缩放，并不会生成局部离子水合取向。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:13
#: 0f67b821072b4766b7b6c1dd7b58c0c3
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:15
#: 04b67bb5da3b41869d2fa5188b660e26
msgid ""
"`固定分子数`直接使用用户给定数量。`按密度估算`根据晶胞体积 $V$、目标密度 $"
"\\rho$、 填充比例 $p$ 和单个溶剂分子摩尔质量 $M$ 计算"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:18
#: 4b109c44464e415d984f5560c1c790f9
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{solv}}=\n"
"\\max\\!\\left(1,\\operatorname{round}\n"
"\\frac{\\rho\\,(V\\times10^{-24})\\,p}{M/N_A}\\right),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:24
#: f343165aea394f0c9289b685d8942644
msgid ""
"其中 $V$ 用 Å³、$\\rho$ 用 g/cm³、$M$ 用 g/mol。随后随机平移和旋转每个溶剂分"
"子， 并用周期最小镜像距离执行碰撞拒绝；显式最小距离与元素共价半径缩放共同决定"
"是否接受。 因此密度模式给出的是目标装填数，不代表未经弛豫的瞬时结构已经达到真"
"实液体平衡密度。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:28
#: deaff6db135f4c1fbdb92558179671b7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:30
#: bc1629bcd7014ee7a6bdb29cd249419f
msgid "场景：模型只见过真空表面，没有见过周期溶剂盒"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: The model has seen vacuum surfaces but no periodic solvent box"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:32
#: f43314ebddb642bfbba9d23ea27517b0
msgid ""
"你要训练一个界面或溶液体系的 NEP，但已有训练集主要是干表面和单分子吸附构型。"
"先准备带 cell 的周期输入结构，用 `Solvent Box Fill` 插入固定数量或按密度估算"
"的水分子，生成一批整盒初态。"
msgstr ""
"For an interface or solution NEP whose data are mostly dry surfaces and "
"single adsorbates, begin from a periodic cell and insert a fixed or density-"
"estimated solvent count to propose full-box initial states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:34
#: 2a5f237109f24c888a9ee710b4d7f8f3
msgid ""
"参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，"
"`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，"
"`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:36
#: 22007950550a43c29e601372ddff01bd
msgid ""
"检查输出时重点看是否插满、是否存在明显短接触、溶剂是否都包回 cell 内，以及后"
"续预松弛是否大面积崩坏。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the target count was reached, short contacts exist, molecules "
"lie within the periodic cell, and pre-relaxation remains stable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:38
#: 2a421c003cb641a686d06441e23b4c60
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:40
#: 8e4e193c618b45dda4afdb294178dd35
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr "Solvent input"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:42
#: d74e1e583e4b47d6b0259a0056163454
msgid "溶剂 XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr "solvent_xyz"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:44
#: a105e96f95b84717b12edb9439a0112c
msgid ""
"`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ block. Stores molecule text, not a "
"path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:46
#: 73f775555f604b94872441d23eacdf92
msgid "每个输入的独立输出数（structures）"
msgstr "structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:48
#: 9e4e0fcf6ea84bf181108f920197dbae
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立填充版本。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Independent box-fill variants per input."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:50
#: 325c7d33e8df42589aa9e984ce128bd0
msgid "数量控制"
msgstr "Count control"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:52
#: d6d8d7f3b24e4c56860878202ad64222
msgid "目标用量（count_mode）"
msgstr "count_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:54
#: 57dd63eaca6c44cd98730bfe6c7850ec
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `fixed`。可选 `fixed`、`按密度`（`density`）。`fixed` 直接使用目"
"标分子数；`按密度`（`density`）根据**完整 cell 体积**、溶剂分子质量、目标密度"
"和数量乘数估算一个名义分子数。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:56
#: d098068e183844d99da93f7975761ed8
msgid "目标溶剂分子数（solvent_count）"
msgstr "solvent_count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:58
#: 81bae9d8fcd84319a6bce097e7309b19
msgid "`int`，默认 100。`count_mode=\"fixed\"` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `100`; fixed mode only."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:60
#: 6808cccf45314c10af841a2d2685a47c
msgid "按密度（density）"
msgstr "density"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:62
#: 40b5ff707b06431ab0f63e9a1b5ae9b4
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0，单位 g/cm³。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时用于估算溶剂分子数"
"量。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.0` g/cm³; density mode only."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:64
#: 28649f49ca8e42fba4bc3b64acce5030
msgid "密度计数系数（fill_packing）"
msgstr "fill_packing"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:66
#: bdb7300e42674c4082bb62e7d188bd1a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0，范围 `(0, 1]`。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时乘到名义纯溶剂分"
"子数上；小于 1 会降低目标数量。大于 1 没有清楚的“填充比例”含义，因此程序不再"
"静默截断，而是直接报错。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:69
#: cad50b2809f1411d8d7813186c88fa4e
msgid ""
"密度模式不会扣除宿主原子、已有溶剂或真空层占据的体积，也不会根据溶质质量反算"
"最终溶液密度。对含表面、溶质或大块固体的 cell，它只是按完整 cell 体积给出的初"
"始数量估计；请看卡片预览中的解析数量，再用 `密度计数系数`（`fill_packing`）或"
"固定数量修正。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:72
#: d33d5df68c644f358459ee889e3ec5a1
msgid "采样和几何约束"
msgstr "Sampling and geometry constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:74
#: a5d5de5e179f49ffbcd3a592046e1cf9
msgid "碰撞配置（sampling_mode）"
msgstr "sampling_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:76
#: ae51b88973fd48d18bdd840aae889349
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`loose`、`dense`。"
"`auto` 只根据溶剂分子是否恰好为 H₂O 解析成 `water` 或 `general`；整盒填充没有"
"局部中心，因此不会进入 `ion-water`。这些配置主要控制 `min_distance=0` 时的默"
"认元素半径缩放，分子整体取向始终是随机的。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:78
#: 8f54a71cb8ba416595be4822b90cd7d4
msgid "统一最小距离覆盖值（min_distance）"
msgstr "min_distance"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 49b2c59bd0974a85ad30add1ddeda93c
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时，所有试放溶剂原子与已有原子之间使用同一个最小距"
"离，并忽略 `元素半径碰撞缩放`（`collision_scale`）；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞半"
"径。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:82
#: 2b72fc7025d943b3ac21b1b568e9bede
msgid "元素半径碰撞缩放（collision_scale）"
msgstr "collision_scale"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:84
#: 90c52319aaff4b67bbd749a63a0a412a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用碰撞配置的内置缩放；大于 0 时覆盖配置默认值。仅"
"在 `min_distance=0` 时生效。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:86
#: 9b93ac3ace874c0a9c412d7521e87761
msgid "每个溶剂分子最大尝试次数（max_attempts_per_solvent）"
msgstr "max_attempts_per_solvent"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:88
#: a11961f1787d4012a3f7e7c4970b1235
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 500。总尝试上限是“该值 × 目标分子数”；若连续拒绝次数达到内部停滞"
"阈值，也会提前停止。高密度盒子触顶时，优先检查目标数量和碰撞规则，再考虑增加"
"它。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:90
#: ea8be1786e794259a93b16b53e6215d3
msgid "严格数量（strict_count）"
msgstr "strict_count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:92
#: 3c180b7071c543d3ae6d05eef881e839
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出至少放入 1 个"
"分子的部分结果。若一个分子都放不进去，仍会报错，避免把未变化的输入标成“已填"
"盒”。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:94
#: 9eb5f68f57f14893b42c84fa219e6f3b
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr "Flexible solvent molecules"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:96
#: 712ae00da790480e984f8d5a1ea43258
msgid "启用柔性溶剂（flex_solvent）"
msgstr "flex_solvent"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:98
#: 5dddc84cad09425aa1583a3c9183fdae
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用“有机构象采样”的几何启发式拓扑生成溶剂构象池，"
"再用于填盒。水没有可旋转单键，因此普通水盒不需要打开；打开后主要只增加高斯坐"
"标噪声。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:100
#: 7770254344fe415d9338fb582f8981af
msgid "柔性构象池（flex_pool）"
msgstr "flex_pool"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:102
#: 24b83a107de840adb7bf2f239f6853eb
msgid "`int`，默认 32。柔性溶剂构象池大小。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `32`. Size of the conformer pool for a flexible solvent."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:104
#: 55c0a014b3ba4c2d885177f8b30e9e0d
msgid "柔性扭转角范围（flex_torsion_range）"
msgstr "flex_torsion_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:106
#: 5af6b8b6ce9a486197de517c9d7ab9f3
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时附"
"加的扭转角增量范围。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:108
#: 8bf0ea2612ab4154a4448b2b42d3c245
msgid "柔性采样最大扭转键数（flex_max_torsions）"
msgstr "flex_max_torsions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:110
#: 6c888bd8f50c44898410c3ecd4ab599e
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `5`. Maximum number of rotatable bonds perturbed in each "
"flexible conformer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:112
#: 2db564a355204f14b053e1ae3f41ba6a
msgid "柔性采样高斯宽度（flex_gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr "flex_gaussian_sigma"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:114
#: 3217304ff8f94ab0859d55d8c45316e9
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.03` Å. Coordinate noise added while generating flexible "
"conformers."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:116
#: f789e59db0ae4cbcb3a22ab401697dc7
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:118
#: b7b08501e7aa4c0dba51082ce3f1afe4
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:120
#: 3b62d9bae6f14b86899fa9188ce59d7d
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后，同一输入结构、参数和 seed 会生成相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, identical input, parameters, and seed "
"produce identical output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:122
#: c4762ab6d6414161bea0e9b5edb4b1ac
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:124
#: d0cea987a87e46419aea14370b039c16
msgid "`int`，默认 0。`use_seed=True` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Used when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:126
#: c603a40503234d6f806f423632373ddb
