msgid "`Solvent Box Fill → Geometry Filter`：先剔除短接触和明显异常盒子。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` -> `Geometry Filter`: reject short contacts and abnormal "
"boxes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:172
#: f030cc65acd6442b8237265edac4a9d1
msgid ""
"`Solvent Box Fill → FPS Filter`：整盒初态很多时，用代表性采样降低 DFT 数量。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` -> `FPS Filter`: reduce many initial boxes to "
"representative DFT candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:174
#: dd73b3e5335f40ed8e2f6a8e991164e8
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:176
#: c486e2f040434a0db2c2932cb9c93c0e
msgid ""
"输入没有有效周期 cell：这张卡需要非奇异 cell 和至少一个周期方向；非周期局部溶"
"剂环境请用 `Local Solvation`。"
msgstr ""
"No valid periodic cell: use a nonsingular cell with periodicity, or choose "
"`Local Solvation` for a nonperiodic local environment."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:177
#: 3294edab8ae84d94ab6d6d9cd4af7473
msgid ""
"无法插满目标数量：降低固定数量或密度数量乘数，减小统一最小距离或元素半径缩"
"放，增大 cell；也可以关闭严格数量先保留非零的部分结果。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:178
#: a18e9d44fd284efeb0b0b6bed6d135a5
msgid ""
"按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由完整 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、目标密度和数"
"量乘数共同决定，不会扣除宿主占据体积。先检查 cell 单位、真空层、已有原子和 `"
"溶剂 XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:179
#: f28f6a741d7940dbb71a5ba64cfb2a6f
msgid ""
"想生成离子第一水合壳：改用 `Local Solvation`。整盒卡不会按离子元素选择 ion–O "
"距离或水分子取向。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:181
#: d3913e1d6a384b8ab82465dc26dae7b5
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:183
#: fd9fb3721f1e4a7fb0b819f720df3f11
msgid "`SolvBox(mode={mode},req={目标数},ok={实际放入数})`"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:185
#: f03f90c907234489bbe6e17dfde082cb
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:187
#: 10d89d8476a04258add60304b3804b45
msgid ""
"打开 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `随机种子"
"`（`seed`）会生成相同填盒结果。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时，cell 体积或 `溶"
"剂 XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）改变会改变目标分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Solvent Box Fill` 在已有周期性晶胞中插入溶剂分子，适合从干结构或稀疏溶剂"
#~ "结构生成整盒溶剂候选初态。输入结构必须有非奇异 cell，并且至少一个周期方向"
#~ "开启。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Solvent Box Fill` inserts solvent molecules into an existing periodic "
#~ "cell to create a full-box candidate from a dry or sparsely solvated "
#~ "structure. Input needs a nonsingular cell and at least one periodic "
#~ "direction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "它解决的是“训练集缺少周期溶剂环境”的覆盖问题，不替代分子动力学平衡或量化优"
#~ "化。输出仍需要做几何筛查和后续 DFT/MD 处理。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "It addresses missing periodic solvent environments; it does not replace "
#~ "MD equilibration or quantum optimization. Output still requires geometry "
#~ "checks and downstream DFT/MD treatment."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，"
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，"
#~ "`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开 `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Parameters: `count_mode=\"fixed\"`, `solvent_count=200`, "
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`, `min_distance=0.8`, "
#~ "`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`, and `use_seed` enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `fixed`。可选 `fixed`、`density`。`fixed` 直接使用 "
#~ "`solvent_count`；`density` 根据 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和 "
#~ "`fill_packing` 估算数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `fixed`. `fixed` uses `solvent_count`; `density` estimates "
#~ "count from cell volume, molecule mass, `density`, and `fill_packing`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.0。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时作为密度缩放因子；小于 1 会"
#~ "降低目标分子数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `1.0`. Packing multiplier for density-based count; "
#~ "values below 1 reduce the target."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`loose`、`dense`。整"
#~ "盒填充不会因为盒子里有离子就自动切到 `ion-water`，因为它没有局部中心原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `auto`. Options are `auto`, `general`, `water`, `loose`, "
#~ "and `dense`. Full-box filling has no local center and therefore does not "
#~ "automatically select `ion-water`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞"
#~ "半径和 `collision_scale`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. A positive value is the global minimum atom-atom "
#~ "distance. At `0`, element-specific collision radii scaled by "
#~ "`collision_scale` are used."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆"
#~ "盖模式默认值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. Zero uses the mode's collision scaling; a positive "
#~ "value overrides it as minimum distance."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 500。每个目标溶剂分子的最大随机放置尝试次数。高密度盒子触顶"
#~ "时，优先检查目标数量和 `min_distance`，再考虑增加它。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `500`. Placement attempts per requested molecule. At high "
#~ "density, check count and collision distances before increasing it."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出部分填充结"
#~ "果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `true`. Fail unless the target count is reached; disabled "
#~ "permits partial fill."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，"
#~ "再用于填盒。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Generate a solvent conformer pool with torsion-"
#~ "guard before filling."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时"
#~ "的扭转角范围。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)` degrees. Torsion-angle "
#~ "range used to generate flexible conformers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "无法插满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count` 或 `fill_packing`，减小 "
#~ "`min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`，增大 cell；也可以关闭 `strict_count` "
#~ "先保留部分可用候选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cannot reach the target: reduce count/packing, revise collision limits, "
#~ "enlarge the cell, or disable `strict_count` to retain partial candidates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、`density` 和 "
#~ "`fill_packing` 共同决定，先检查 cell 单位、真空层和 `solvent_xyz` 是否正"
#~ "确。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unexpected density-based count: verify cell units, vacuum volume, solvent "
#~ "mass/text, density, and packing factor."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` 会生成相同填盒结"
#~ "果。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时，cell 体积或 `solvent_xyz` 改变会改变目标"
#~ "分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed`, identical input, order, parameters, and seed reproduce "
#~ "filling. In density mode, changing cell volume or solvent text changes "
#~ "the target count and output."
